{
 "cells": [
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "# Untwisted $\\mathfrak{su}(4)$ orthogonality at $L=2$ — conventions of arXiv:2603.26617\n\nThis notebook repeats the zero-twist construction directly in the conventions of the paper. We use\n\n$$f^{[a]}(u)=f(u+ai/2),\\qquad Q_\\theta(u)=\\prod_{\\alpha=1}^2(u-\\theta_\\alpha),$$\n\nand the paper's Baxter operators (C1), (C15) and bracket (E1). The local representation is the six-dimensional $[1,1,0,0]$ at each of the two sites. We keep generic inhomogeneities during the residue calculation and use $\\theta_1=1/3$, $\\theta_2=1/7$ for exact checks.\n\n## Convention dictionary\n\nRelative to `SU4_SoV_Orthogonality_Untwisted_L2.wb`, set $h=i$ and recenter the contour variable by $u_{\\rm old}=u+i$. Then\n\n$$\\nu_1(u)=Q_\\theta^{[-2]}(u),\\qquad \\nu_4(u)=Q_\\theta(u),$$\n$$E_{2,\\rm old}(u+i)=\\frac{1}{Q_\\theta^{[-2]}(u)Q_\\theta(u)Q_\\theta^{[2]}(u)}.$$\n\nThe direct functions are unchanged, $Q_k(u)=q_k(u)$, while the dual solution in the centered bracket is $Q^j(u)=q^j_{\\rm old}(u+i)$. The transfer matrices are\n\n$$\\tau_+(u)=T_1(u),\\qquad \\tau_0(u)=T_2(u+i/2),\\qquad \\tau_-(u)=t_3(u+i),$$\n\nwhere $T_3=Q_\\theta(u)Q_\\theta(u-3i)t_3(u)$.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 1. Paper conventions and a direct exact zero-twist solver. ---- *)\nClearAll[θ1, θ2, θrules26, sh, qθ, τp, τ0, τm, cp, cm, c02, c01, c00, chargeVars, qpoly26, B26, Bd26, irreps26, degQ26, degQu26, cq26, cu26, solve26, states26];\nθrules26 = {θ1 -> 1/3, θ2 -> 1/7};\nsh[f_, a_][u_] := f[u + a I/2];\nqθ[u_] := (u - θ1) (u - θ2);\nchargeVars = {cp, c02, c01, c00, cm};\nτp[u_] := 4 u^2 - 4 (θ1 + θ2 + I) u + cp;\nτ0[u_] := 6 u^4 - 12 (θ1 + θ2 + I) u^3 + c02 u^2 + c01 u + c00;\nτm[u_] := 4 u^2 - 4 (θ1 + θ2 + I) u + cm;\nqpoly26[c_List, y_] := c . y^Range[0, Length[c] - 1];\n(* Equations (C1) and (C15); note the easily missed τ_-^[2] and τ_+^[2]. *)\nB26[qf_][u_] := qθ[u + I] qθ[u] qf[u - 2 I] - τp[u] qθ[u + I] qf[u - I] + τ0[u + I/2] qf[u] - τm[u + I] qθ[u - I] qf[u + I] + qθ[u - I] qθ[u] qf[u + 2 I];\nBd26[g_][u_] := qθ[u + I] qθ[u] g[u - 2 I] - τm[u] qθ[u + I] g[u - I] + τ0[u + I/2] g[u] - τp[u + I] qθ[u - I] g[u + I] + qθ[u - I] qθ[u] g[u + 2 I];\nirreps26 = {{2, 2, 0, 0}, {2, 1, 1, 0}, {1, 1, 1, 1}};\ndegQ26[mu_] := 2 - mu + Range[0, 3];\ndegQu26[mu_, j_] := mu[[j]] + 4 - j;\nsolve26[mu_] := Module[{d = degQ26[mu], x, pf, eqs, sol, rec, dual = <||>, js = {4, 3, 2, 1}, g, dd},\n  pf[k_] := Function[y, Evaluate[y^d[[k]] + Sum[cq26[k, m] y^m, {m, 0, d[[k]] - 1}]]];\n  eqs = Join[\n    DeleteCases[Flatten[Table[CoefficientList[Expand[B26[pf[k]][x] /. θrules26], x], {k, 4}]], 0],\n    Flatten[Table[If[d[[l]] < d[[k]], cq26[k, d[[l]]], Nothing], {k, 4}, {l, k - 1}]]];\n  sol = Solve[(# == 0 &) /@ eqs, Join[chargeVars, Flatten[Table[cq26[k, m], {k, 4}, {m, 0, d[[k]] - 1}]]]];\n  If[Length[sol] =!= 1, Return[$Failed]];\n  rec = <|\"mu\" -> mu, \"charges\" -> (chargeVars /. First[sol]), \"Q\" -> Table[CoefficientList[pf[k][x] /. First[sol], x], {k, 4}]|>;\n  Do[\n    dd = degQu26[mu, j];\n    g = Function[y, Evaluate[y^dd + Sum[cu26[j, m] y^m, {m, 0, dd - 1}]]];\n    eqs = Join[\n      DeleteCases[CoefficientList[Expand[Bd26[g][x] /. Thread[chargeVars -> rec[\"charges\"]] /. θrules26], x], 0],\n      Table[If[degQu26[mu, js[[b]]] < dd, cu26[j, degQu26[mu, js[[b]]]], Nothing], {b, First@First@Position[js, j] - 1}]];\n    sol = Solve[(# == 0 &) /@ eqs, Table[cu26[j, m], {m, 0, dd - 1}]];\n    dual[j] = If[Length[sol] === 1, CoefficientList[g[x] /. First[sol], x], $Failed],\n    {j, js}];\n  Append[rec, \"Qu\" -> dual]];\nstates26 = solve26 /@ irreps26;\nGrid[Prepend[Table[{If[r === $Failed, \"—\", r[\"mu\"]], r =!= $Failed, If[r === $Failed, \"—\", r[\"charges\"]]}, {r, states26}], {\"irrep\", \"unique solution\", \"{c+,c02,c01,c00,c-}\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"331408\" data-output-id=\"42\" data-out-n=\"291\" data-sub-idx=\"18\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"1\" data-sub-start=\"35\" data-sub-end=\"35\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[291]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"8\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:4.9045em;vertical-align:-2.1823em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.7223em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.6823em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.6823em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:4.8645em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.1823em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.6823em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.8423em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">irrep</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6208em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span c