an class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">j=0</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:4.8em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.15em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.65em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.65em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.65em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.65em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.65em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[297]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|c|}\\hline\\text{irrep} & \\text{deg Q\\_1..Q\\_4} & \\text{deg Q\\^{}4..Q\\^{}1} & \\text{B Q\\_j=0} & \\text{B$\\dag$ Q\\^{}j=0}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{2,2,0,0\\right\\} & \\left\\{0,1,4,5\\right\\} & \\left\\{0,1,4,5\\right\\} & \\mathrm{True} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{2,1,1,0\\right\\} & \\left\\{0,2,3,5\\right\\} & \\left\\{0,2,3,5\\right\\} & \\mathrm{True} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{1,1,1,1\\right\\} & \\left\\{1,2,3,4\\right\\} & \\left\\{1,2,3,4\\right\\} & \\mathrm{True} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "3039aa0f-b9f9-4459-86c1-736b1d5b1f08"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Collapse to two charge differences\n\nFor any two states $A,B$, the five charge differences collapse in the paper variables to\n\n$$\\Delta\\tau_+(u)=\\Delta t,\\qquad \\Delta\\tau_-(u)=\\Delta t,$$\n$$\\Delta\\tau_0^+(u)=\\Delta t\\bigl(Q_\\theta^{[-2]}(u)+Q_\\theta^{[2]}(u)\\bigr)+\\Delta c'.$$\n\nFor the present $L=2$ chain,\n\n$$\\Delta t=-\\frac12\\Delta C_2,$$\n$$\\Delta c'=\\frac18\\Delta(C_2^2)-\\frac14\\Delta C_4+\\frac34\\Delta C_2.$$\n\nSubstitution into equation (E3) gives the two columns\n\n$$F_1=Q_A^j\\left[Q_\\theta^{[-2]}(Q_i^{B[2]}-Q_i^B)+Q_\\theta^{[2]}(Q_i^{B[-2]}-Q_i^B)\\right],\\qquad F_2=-Q_A^jQ_i^B.$$\n\nBoth are integrated with the paper measure\n\n$$\\frac{du}{Q_\\theta^{[-2]}Q_\\theta Q_\\theta^{[2]}}.$$\n\nWe take the working pairing $(i,j)=(2,1)$.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 3. Casimir identities and the 2x2 paper-convention matrix. ---- *)\nClearAll[xw26, pw26, C226, C426, τpR26, τ0R26, τmR26, inv26, invCas26, Epaper26, ladder26, NpaperLadder26];\nxw26[mu_] := Table[mu[[k]] + 5/2 - k, {k, 4}];\npw26[mu_, n_] := Total[xw26[mu]^n];\nC226[mu_] := pw26[mu, 2] - 5;\nC426[mu_] := pw26[mu, 4] + 4 pw26[mu, 3] - pw26[mu, 1] pw26[mu, 2] + pw26[mu, 2]/2 - 2 pw26[mu, 1]^2 - 10 pw26[mu, 1] - 51/4;\nτpR26[r_][u_] := τp[u] /. transferRules26[r];\nτ0R26[r_][u_] := τ0[u] /. transferRules26[r];\nτmR26[r_][u_] := τm[u] /. transferRules26[r];\ninv26[A_, B_] := Module[{dt, dcp},\n  dt = A[\"charges\"][[1]] - B[\"charges\"][[1]];\n  dcp = Expand[(τ0R26[A][I/2] - τ0R26[B][I/2]) - dt (qθ[-I] + qθ[I])] /. θrules26;\n  {dt, dcp}];\ninvCas26[A_, B_] := Module[{ma = A[\"mu\"], mb = B[\"mu\"]},\n  {-(C226[ma] - C226[mb])/2,\n   (C226[ma]^2 - C226[mb]^2)/8 - (C426[ma] - C426[mb])/4 + 3 (C226[ma] - C226[mb])/4}];\nEpaper26[u_] := 1/(qθ[u - I] qθ[u] qθ[u + I]) /. θrules26;\nladder26[f_, s_, u_] := Sum[Residue[Epaper26[u] f, {u, ({θ1, θ2}[[s]] + k I) /. θrules26}], {k, -1, 1}];\nNpaperLadder26[A_, B_, i_: 2, j_: 1] := Module[{u, qa, qb, f1, f2},\n  qa[x_] := qUpper26[A][j][x];\n  qb[x_] := qLower26[B][i][x];\n  f1 = Expand[qa[u] ((qθ[u - I] (qb[u + I] - qb[u]) + qθ[u + I] (qb[u - I] - qb[u])) /. θrules26)];\n  f2 = Expand[-qa[u] qb[u]];\n  Table[{ladder26[f1, s, u], ladder26[f2, s, u]}, {s, 2}]];\nchargeIdentityChecks26 = Flatten[Table[\n   {inv26[A, B] === invCas26[A, B],\n    Expand[(τpR26[A][u] - τpR26[B][u]) - inv26[A, B][[1]]] === 0,\n    Expand[(τmR26[A][u] - τmR26[B][u]) - inv26[A, B][[1]]] === 0,\n    Expand[(τ0R26[A][u + I/2] - τ0R26[B][u + I/2]) - inv26[A, B][[1]] ((qθ[u - I] + qθ[u + I]) /. θrules26) - inv26[A, B][[2]]] === 0},\n   {A, states26}, {B, states26}], 1];\npairChecks26 = Flatten[Table[With[{n = NpaperLadder26[A, B]},\n    {If[A === B, Det[n] =!= 0, Det[n] === 0], If[A === B, True, Together[n . inv26[A, B]] === {0, 0}]}],\n   {A, states26}, {B, states26}], 1];\nGrid[{\n  {\"Casimir formula for {Δt,Δc'}, all 9 ordered pairs\", Count[chargeIdentityChecks26[[All, 1]], True], \"/9\"},\n  {\"Δτ+ = Δt\", Count[chargeIdentityChecks26[[All, 2]], True], \"/9\"},\n  {\"Δτ- = Δt\", Count[chargeIdentityChecks26[[All, 3]], True], \"/9\"},\n  {\"Δτ0+ = Δt(Qθ[-2]+Qθ[2])+Δc'\", Count[chargeIdentityChecks26[[All, 4]], True], \"/9\"},\n  {\"3 norms nonzero and 6 cross determinants zero\", Count[pairChecks26[[All, 1]], True], \"/9\"},\n  {\"cross matrices annihilate {Δt,Δc'}\", Count[pairChecks26[[All, 2]], True], \"/9\"}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"331408\" data-output-id=\"44\" data-out-n=\"313\" data-sub-idx=\"16\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"4\" data-sub-start=\"33\" data-sub-end=\"39\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[313]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"8\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:7.24em;vertical-align:-3.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.89em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.85em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.85em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:7.2em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-3.35em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.85em;\"><span style=\"top:-6.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Casimir formula for {Δt,Δc’}, all 9 ordered pairs</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mord\">+ = Δt</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mord\">- = Δt</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mord\">0+ = Δt(Q</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mord\">[-2]+Q</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mord\">[2])+Δc’</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">3 norms nonzero and 6 cross determinants zero</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cross matrices annihilate {Δt,Δc’}</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:7.2em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-3.35em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.85em;\"><span style=\"top:-6.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">9</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">9</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">9</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">9</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">9</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">9</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:7.2em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-3.35em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.85em;\"><span style=\"top:-6.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">/9</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">/9</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">/9</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">/9</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">/9</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">/9</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:7.2em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-3.35em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.85em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.85em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.85em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.85em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.85em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-8.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.85em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-9.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.85em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[313]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|c|}\\hline\\text{Casimir formula for \\{$\\Delta$t,$\\Delta$c'\\}, all 9 ordered pairs} & 9 & \\text{/9}\\\\\\hline\\text{$\\Delta$$\\tau$+ = $\\Delta$t} & 9 & \\text{/9}\\\\\\hline\\text{$\\Delta$$\\tau$- = $\\Delta$t} & 9 & \\text{/9}\\\\\\hline\\text{$\\Delta$$\\tau$0+ = $\\Delta$t(Q$\\theta$[-2]+Q$\\theta$[2])+$\\Delta$c'} & 9 & \\text{/9}\\\\\\hline\\text{3 norms nonzero and 6 cross determinants zero} & 9 & \\text{/9}\\\\\\hline\\text{cross matrices annihilate \\{$\\Delta$t,$\\Delta$c'\\}} & 9 & \\text{/9}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "7ff049a8-74e6-469f-ae41-28c71a142cd5"
